---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../data/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Saurabh Nandwana"
  description="Background, career journey from Rajasthan to startups and video infrastructure, nomad lifestyle, and current engineering focus."
>
  <div class="about-page container-narrow">
    <header class="about-header">
      <img src="/avatar.jpg" alt={siteConfig.author} class="about-avatar" />
      <div>
        <h1 class="about-title">Saurabh Nandwana</h1>
        <p class="about-role">Engineer & Builder · Founder of unfoundbox</p>
        <div class="about-location">
          <span class="geo-dot"></span>
          <span>Based in Udaipur, India & Nomading in SE Asia</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="prose about-prose">
      <p>
        Hey there! I'm Saurabh. I’ve spent the last decade as an early-stage startup engineer and founder working across fintech, video compression, applied machine learning, and high-scale browser infrastructure.
      </p>

      <h2>Background & Path</h2>
      <p>
        I grew up in a small town in Rajasthan, discovered C++ in high school, and went to Kota for IIT-JEE prep before heading to BIT Bangalore for engineering. After realizing the traditional lecture hall wasn't teaching me how to actually build software, I took a leap, dropped out, and joined <a href="https://www.signzy.com" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Signzy</a> at the seed stage.
      </p>
      <p>
        At Signzy, I worked directly with the founding team building digital KYC pipelines and computer vision extraction algorithms. Later, I joined <a href="https://sambhattacharyya.com/vectorly" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Vectorly</a> — an MIT-backed video compression startup — where we built client-side neural video upscaling engines in WebGL and WASM. Vectorly was acqui-hired by <a href="https://hopin.com" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Hopin</a> during the peak of the virtual events boom.
      </p>
      <p>
        At Hopin and subsequently <a href="https://streamyard.com" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">StreamYard</a>, I worked on applied ML, automated clip extraction, WebCodecs/WebRTC live broadcast infrastructure, and developer SDKs used by millions of live stream creators worldwide.
      </p>

      <h2>Current Focus</h2>
      <p>
        I’m currently operating as an independent builder and researcher, focused on:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Local AI on WebGPU:</strong> Running structured small language models and vision models directly on client hardware without cloud round-trips.</li>
        <li><strong>Modern Web Platforms:</strong> Leveraging WebCodecs, WebGPU, WebTransport, and 3D Gaussian splatting to bring desktop-grade workflows to the browser.</li>
        <li><strong>Independent Tools:</strong> Shipping products like <a href="https://launchy.video" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Launchy.video</a> (automated launch videos) and <a href="https://lookaround.space" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Lookaround.space</a> (navigable 3D web environments).</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Digital Nomad Life</h2>
      <p>
        When I'm not writing code or experimenting with neural nets, I spend time exploring South East Asia — living out of Bangkok, Da Nang, Koh Phangan, and my hometown of Udaipur.
      </p>

      <h2>Connect</h2>
      <p>
        I'm always open to discussing new ideas, collaborating on edge AI experiments, or chatting about startup engineering:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>X (Twitter):</strong> <a href={siteConfig.social.twitter} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">@unfoundbox</a></li>
        <li><strong>GitHub:</strong> <a href={siteConfig.social.github} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">github.com/unfoundbox</a></li>
        <li><strong>LinkedIn:</strong> <a href={siteConfig.social.linkedin} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">linkedin.com/in/saurabh-nandwana</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-page {
    padding: 3.5rem 0 6rem;
  }

  .about-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    padding-bottom: 2rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }

  .about-avatar {
    width: 88px;
    height: 88px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 2px solid var(--border-medium);
  }

  .about-title {
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .about-role {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--accent-light);
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }

  .about-location {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .geo-dot {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    background: #10b981;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .about-header {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 1rem;
    }
  }
</style>
